    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA wonderful opportunity has arisen to acquire a spacious detached family residence situated in a mature and sought after residential area in Ashleigh Lawns, a leafy cul-de-sac off St. Margaret's Road just a stroll from the centre of Malahide village and every conceivable amenity.Behind its attractive façade, the property offers spacious family accommodation. While it would benefit from modernisation, its generous proportions and excellent layout provide an ideal opportunity to create an exceptional forever home. Many features include a gloss fitted kitchen, split level dining and living room, sunroom, 4 generous bedrooms and spacious Study / Tv Room which could provide an option of a downstairs bedroom with guest en suite bathroom.Outside, the private front driveway provides secure off-street parking and is framed by mature hedging. To the rear a large, west-facing rear garden, offering exceptional privacy and an ideal orientation to capture the afternoon and evening sun.Superbly positioned in one of Malahide's most sought-after residential enclaves, right in the heart of this charming coastal village. Tucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac, the property is just a gentle stroll from every conceivable amenity including excellent schools, churches, local shops, boutiques, restaurants and the DART station. The picturesque Marina and the gates to Malahide Castle and Demesne are also close by, further enhancing this exceptional location.To appreciate this excellent family residence viewing is essential."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.86m x 1.78m\nSpacious entrance hall, carpet flooring, guest wc\n\nGuest Wc - 1.42m x 1.10m\nComprising hand wash basin, wc\n\nOffice - 4.25m x 2.89m\nOffice with large double glazed window, carpet flooring, shower room off\n\nShower Room - 1.96m x 1.68m\nFully tiled comprising walk in shower, wc, hand wash basin\n\nKitchen/ Breakfast Room - 4.71m x 2.56m\nLarge kitchen/ breakfast room with ample floor and wall storage units, tiled splashback, Siemens double oven, hob and extractor fan, large double glazed window and door to side entrance\n\nLiving Room - 4.83m x 3.65m\nBright living room with open fireplace, feauture brick wall, carpet flooring and sliding doors to sun room\n\nDining Room - 3.72m x 2.88m\nLarge dining room with double glazed window\n\nConservatory - 4.15m x 2.89m\nSun room with access to rear garden and tiled floor\n\nLanding - 2.90m x 2.82m\nCarpet landing with large hotpress\n\nBathroom - 2.55m x 2.10m\nFully tiled family bathroom comprising bath, shower, wc, hand wash basin and frosted window\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.11m x 3.64m\nLarge double glazed window, carpet flooring\n\nEnsuite - 2.55m x 2.10m\nFully tiled comprising walk in shower, hand wash basin\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.37m x 2.78m\nLarge double glazed window, carpet flooring, built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.76m x 3.58m\nLarge double glazed window, carpet flooring, built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.48m x 2.71m\nLarge double glazed window, carpet flooring, built in wardrobes\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Family residence in village centre location</li><li>Large private west facing garden</li><li>Double glazed windows throughout</li><li>Four spacious bedrooms </li><li>Off-street parking to accommodate several cars</li><li>Exceptional development potential subject to PP</ul>"
      },
